{"page":20162,"part":1,"text":"第四 筋法\n\n右指法。\n\n\n　　 第四 筋法\n\n　　 藏 首尾蹲抢。（解“藏”“度”二字，则无死笔，活处在筋也。）\n\n　　 度 中间空中飞度。\n\n　　 字之筋，笔锋是也。断处藏之，连处度之。藏者首尾蹲抢是也，度者空中打势，飞度笔意也。\n\n　　 右字法。（一画亦要藏、度，不专是断处，连处。）\n\n　　 中指下贯上，左贯右'笔中柔。\n\n　　 名指上贯下'右贯左，笔中韧。\n\n　　 右指法。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20162,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"1659239e3f108372c2b970bc4d353336c65fdb1b5869ccb12c7048e45ca66a93","textSha256":"1659239e3f108372c2b970bc4d353336c65fdb1b5869ccb12c7048e45ca66a93","fileSha256":"1659239e3f108372c2b970bc4d353336c65fdb1b5869ccb12c7048e45ca66a93","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20162-work-127.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"翰林要诀 · 第四 筋法","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/4JuVN7mkqoqQ3sCHF1StYc","originalPages":[494,495],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"a1e9afe1359a9fa2a613cb1b016ff787184e0dda40f5e4e9f279e1b6ade52dcb","id":"local-494-307-319","page_id":494,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":307,"rawEnd":319,"reviewedTextSha256":"a57a6978b89f13a65d211c251655b669e900543098f1d5528e39e45555ad6caf","displayUnitOrigins":[[313,314],[314,315],[315,316],[316,317],[317,318]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":494,"part":2,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"姜淼","verifiedAt":"2026-10-21T08:31:17.815Z","revision":"a57a6978b89f13a65d211c251655b669e900543098f1d5528e39e45555ad6caf","textSha256":"a57a6978b89f13a65d211c251655b669e900543098f1d5528e39e45555ad6caf","fileSha256":"71775c6db948d17543d8360116b802abe366783e6084608c786f48215b4861ea","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/batch-02/extracted/member-6-part-2/第2份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/batch-02/extracted/member-6-part-2/第2份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/batch-02/extr